{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c64047e1a5bf51cc27bb1faaf48b5cd20301bcbf70a4601223b1058c59e322ff", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』のパジャマ特集\nの撮影だが、準備に時間がかかってるみたいだな……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的睡衣特辑，不过准备工作好像要花不少时间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "575ef169b7e58675de0a0de12b5dcbfbb0a138bb0054206c62487ef25ffcbced", "ja": "ねえねえ、兄ちゃ～ん。撮影まだ始まんないの？\n杏仁フクロウの尾が切れちゃうよ～！", "zh": "喂喂，哥哥～，拍摄还没开始吗？\n杏仁猫头鹰的尾巴要断啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1002_p", "source_sha256": "495fdb5655c201e13443e23955f50e5980684a69ade08c30ecb733d05ad9d4f2", "ja": "杏仁フクロウの尾……？　ああ、堪忍ブクロの緒か。\nすまん亜美、もう少し我慢してくれ。", "zh": "杏仁猫头鹰的尾巴……？啊，是忍耐袋的系带吧。\n抱歉，亚美，再忍耐一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "af036c1573d229c6aa2f1365449d6a4c7c261eda7b8c4bbbead2576df74d12f3", "ja": "え～、せっかくかわいいパジャマ着たのに、これじゃ、\n亜美のもちベーションがぺったんぺったんだよ～！", "zh": "诶～，亚美好不容易穿上了可爱的睡衣，结果这样，干劲都被压扁啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "09feb695dea4e6c60a21a3a7a92e19906d32fa1973da637f4fbfd833b82f1fcb", "ja": "あっ、そうだ！　兄ちゃん、撮影が始まるまで、\nパジャマパーティーして遊ぼー？", "zh": "啊，对了！兄长，在拍摄开始前，来办睡衣派对一起玩吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "ddc1c24d73ce8fb6d06b662a80193208f41ae24ccbde22c8c42dbe0ceb949a15", "ja": "そしたら亜美のおもちベーションも、\nぷくぷく～ってふくらむからさ！", "zh": "这样亚美的年糕动力也会噗噗地膨胀起来啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4acbd926bbd8f21fd2b518405319d076f25c4a978a18680fcfa6197a5039df7e", "ja": "まあ、それで頑張ってくれるなら、\n付き合ってやるか！", "zh": "嗯，要是这样你就能好好努力的话，那我就陪你吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "ad675a09c9e5ccca03e104e27de52e24f8d51989fb9ba46e09ceb13b8f1810f1", "ja": "やった～！　んじゃ、さっそくパーティスタート～！\nパジャマっていえば、やっぱこの話だよね！", "zh": "太好了～！那就马上开始派对吧～！\n说到睡衣，果然还是得聊这个话题呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "eec783fbf13db10263440d0e01adb4db8710ad60e659c0afec45648a869d75cc", "ja": "兄ちゃん、カノジョとかいんの？？", "zh": "哥哥，你有女朋友吗？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1f3de492af7f844f5ce7210f321e85c439c85964f8bef4bb4560b0cfe708b4cf", "ja": "ぶはっ！？　なんでそんな話になるんだ？\nパジャマとは関係ないだろ。", "zh": "噗哈！？怎么突然聊到这个了？\n这跟睡衣有什么关系啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "8bf2c76b8fda79c696e2fe91d1f183d413505d00e55022227624936e5747d9c1", "ja": "関係大アリっしょー？　パジャマパーティーには、\nこーゆー恋バナがお約束なんだよ！", "zh": "关系可大了吧——？睡衣派对上，这种恋爱话题可是必不可少的呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "e62c9ee17919a9299125ece512eb93dcdab0c2d139c5591e47079f72c98e4c8c", "ja": "ほらほら、吐くんだ、兄ちゃん！　吐いて楽になろ？\nそしたらカツ丼食べさせてあげてもいいよ！　あーん♪", "zh": "快说快说，招了吧，哥哥！说出来就轻松了嘛？  \n这样的话，给你吃炸猪排盖饭也不是不可以哦！啊——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1012_p", "source_sha256": "fbf71a43cc79c64c54ff83aa775c64861c4f490ac68d5624a9a4d795b5974aa4", "ja": "い、いつの間にか取調べに……いや、そうでもない？\n……とにかく、その質問、答えなきゃいけないのか？", "zh": "不、不知不觉变成审讯了……不对，好像又不是？\n……总之，这个问题我非回答不可吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "07aa052203f84f4de110773108d2ca6fbfca957e603fb39e8e642a057e66b8a1", "ja": "トーゼンっしょー！　どうしてもイヤなら、\n好きなタイプでもいいからさ～。", "zh": "当然啦！如果实在不想回答，说说你喜欢的类型也行嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5a2f9583778ac80c01c4c48d8bec67c8341964ea01c330cbbfb56981e1c10003", "ja": "うーん、そうだなあ……。強いて言うなら、\nやる気を出してお仕事を頑張る妹系アイドル、かな。", "zh": "嗯——，是这样啊……非要说的话，\n大概是那种打起精神努力工作的妹妹系偶像吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "1bce8defc5204a34ee76af73bfbf1f33724d9824e9182fda5d49489788b7070c", "ja": "やる気を出してお仕事を頑張る、\n妹系ぷりちー美少女天使アイドル……？", "zh": "打起精神努力工作的妹妹系可爱美少女天使偶像……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "80c0fa376c5621f2de75b005c02a89abf48540cc3b0c6b17601baf7adbf6f715", "ja": "それって、もしかしてもしなくても、\n亜美のことだよね？　ぜったいそうだよねっ？", "zh": "不管怎么想，\n说的都是亚美吧？绝对是这样吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9b53f2c80359b8ed42feb99d875e3bc098a65b6294e82d68cd9df1211af32a16", "ja": "なんか増えてるけど……亜美がやる気を出して\n頑張ってくれたら、そういうことになるな。", "zh": "好像多了点什么，不过……只要亚美打起精神努力帮忙，就会变成那样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1018_011ami", "source_sha256": "f6cfdf5941ab222fddc152d7f610db057a07275984e1bcec7743feaf99cb0e14", "ja": "も～、兄ちゃんてば、仕方ないな～。もちベーション、\nふくらませてあげるね！　ぷくぷくぷくーっ！！", "zh": "真是的～，胸口兄真是拿你没办法～。\n就让我来帮你把干劲吹得鼓鼓的吧！咕嘟咕嘟咕嘟——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0213_1019_p", "source_sha256": "431502b9062272025e702adbb64803415078bb02f5509b9c3c0f863ca793d04a", "ja": "（亜美のやる気が出たところで、準備も終わり、\n撮影が始まった。これなら、いい写真が撮れそうだ！）", "zh": "（亚美打起精神后，准备也都完成了，拍摄开始了。这样应该能拍出不错的照片了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
